<title>THAILAND: Thai Oil secures $216 mln loan for project.</title>
<headline>Thai Oil secures $216 mln loan for project.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Oil Co Ltd, the operator of the country's largest refinery, said on Monday the firm had signed a loan agreement of $216 million for its second hydrosulphurisation unit.</p>
<p>The loan was on a seven-year term with the interest rate of 90 basis points over LIBOR and was secured from 19 financial institutions abroad, the company said.</p>
</text>
